      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i feel really weird... im shaking a lot and i'm super sweaty. i checked my sugar about an hour ago and it was actually kinda high (180), so i think it might be dropping too fast or something? should i just take an extra unit of my rapid insulin now to keep it steady?",
