      "content": "but i'm worried because if i eat sugar now and it's actually just a spike coming, i'll be way too high later. i feel so lightheaded and confused... if i just take 1 or 2 units of fast acting insulin it should bring it back to a normal range, right? it's safer than guessing with food.",
